summary = "Showcases 3 Access Point modes reusing the same 3 Tween Sequence Frames (Squish & Hop, Color Pulse, and Rest):
1. 'Random Ambient (Random Selector)' (default): Picks a random animation sequence each cycle.
2. 'Deterministic Cycle (Sequence)': Steps through Squish -> Color -> Rest in strict order.
3. 'Simultaneous Show (Parallel)': Runs Squish & Stretch and Color Pulse at the same time."
